        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapformer is the ultimate test in a punishing platformer adventure! Prepare to navigate through 20 dangerous levels filled with hidden traps that will test your sanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch out for traps! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Trapformer, your objective is simple: Reach the end of each level as quickly as possible while avoiding a wide range of deadly traps. From spikes to floors disappearing, falling hammers to fireballs, every step you take could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912730/extras/e35ee5dfd0fa4ffaa374097ccdc0341d.poster.avif?t=1760979653\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912730/extras/e35ee5dfd0fa4ffaa374097ccdc0341d.webm?t=1760979653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912730/extras/e35ee5dfd0fa4ffaa374097ccdc0341d.mp4?t=1760979653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on the death counter as it keeps track of every misstep and miscalculation.</p>",
